{"id":"45e118fdc159a03d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-path.md","title":"Directed Reachability","display":"df-path — Directed Reachability","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-finite-graph]]"],"display":"df-path — Directed Reachability","label":"28-df-path","aliases":["28-df-path"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-path — Directed Reachability"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-path"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-path</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}\">\\(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}\\)</span> (有限有向图, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in V\">\\(s,t\\in V\\)</span> (端点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)\\)</span> (从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的有向路径集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}:\\{(G,s,t)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\;s,t\\in V\\}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}:\\{(G,s,t)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\;s,t\\in V\\}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> （<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>，下式固定同一图及端点编码）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PATH}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{PATH}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (可达性语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}(G,s,t)\\qquad(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ s,t\\in V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}(G,s,t)\\qquad(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ s,t\\in V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb{N}}\\{\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_m\\rangle\\in V^{m+1}\\mid v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;((v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb{N}}\\{\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_m\\rangle\\in V^{m+1}\\mid v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;((v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PATH}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}(G,s,t)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}\\land s,t\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)\\neq\\emptyset\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PATH}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}(G,s,t)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}\\land s,t\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)\\neq\\emptyset\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源核对：式(4.1)；印刷82页；PDF108页。有向可达性已核对；本目录允许零步路径。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-finite-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}$ (有限有向图, see [[28-df-finite-graph]])","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}:\\{(G,s,t)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\;s,t\\in V\\}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ （$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}$ 见 [[28-df-finite-graph]]，下式固定同一图及端点编码）","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}:\\{(G,s,t)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\;s,t\\in V\\}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PATH}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}(G,s,t)\\qquad(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ s,t\\in V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb{N}}\\{\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_m\\rangle\\in V^{m+1}\\mid v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i<m\\;((v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PATH}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{PATH}}(G,s,t)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}\\land s,t\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Path}_G(s,t)\\neq\\emptyset\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"空间完全问题：[[28-df-path]]、[[28-thm-path-nl-complete]]、[[28-df-tqbf]]、[[28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete]]。"},{"id":"8380a071500296f8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PATH}$、$\\mathbf{NL}$、$\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}$ 分别见 [[28-df-path]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":["dada5c223e508373"]}